# Whitelist: only code, layout data and notes are tracked.  Everything derived
# from the ROMs (helper images, dumps, disassemblies, built sets, renders,
# recordings) stays out - the repo must never carry ROM data.
*
!.gitignore
!*/
!*.py
!*.json
!*.md
!*.lua
!*.sh
!*.cpp
*.bak
__pycache__/
patched*/
roms_*/
snap*/
nvram*/
cfg/
artroms/
blankroms/
models/
trackset/
virset/
ui/
dasm/
